==============================================================================
PART 3: IFLS-5 raw data (NOT included in this package)
==============================================================================

The Indonesian Family Life Survey wave 5 (IFLS-5) raw microdata files are
the property of RAND Corporation and are licensed under RAND's separate
data-use agreement (https://www.rand.org/well-being/social-and-behavioral-
policy/data/FLS/IFLS.html). This replication package does NOT redistribute
IFLS-5 raw data. Users must register independently with RAND and accept the
data-use agreement to obtain raw IFLS-5 files.

This package's derived datasets (in data/processed/) contain aggregated and
transformed values; per RAND's data-use policy, sharing derived datasets
that do not allow reconstruction of individual records is permitted for
non-commercial research replication.
